[40.673,"o","   ✓ Apply the settings given in the stack\r\n\r\n✔ OpenVidu Pro (elastic) is up on Oracle Cloud\r\n  URL:          https://openvidu-klbp9j-51-170-39-11.sslip.io/\r\n  credentials:  oci secrets secret-bundle get-secret-bundle-by-name --secret-name OPENVIDU_URL --vault-id *** --query 'data.\"secret-bundle-content\".content' --raw-output --region eu-madrid-1 | base64 -d\r\n\r\nTry it:\r\n  ov stack status\r\n  ov stack logs --tail 50\r\n"]
